==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*6 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 43.33~50 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Li'l Doge]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Rain D.]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'Behemoth]] spawns after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Very non-threatening stage. Bring something that can deal with the Rain D in some way and you win. Le'Behemoth lacks pushing power.
Due to the late spawn time of Le'Behemoth, it can be possible to take out a large chunk of Rain D's health before it spawns, or even knock Rain D behind the base and clear the stage before the Le'Behemoth spawns

